        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Unit members shall receive fifteen (15) days off to be used when classes are not in session during the nine (9) month contract period, only during Christmas closure, spring break, or as specifically approved by the dean or director, or designee. Two (2) days of time off shall be provided for each additional month of full-time appointment each year. Time off shall not accrue from one contract period to the next if not used, and no payment is made for time off not used when a unit member terminates employment. Provided the other requirements of this article are met, unit members may use time off received in a fiscal year during",
